"protected","default"],"answer":"B","explanation":"private 私有权限，作用范围最小。"},{"id":"j078","moduleId":"module-14","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["modifier","errorPoint"],"question":"被 static 修饰的成员属于？","options":["对象","类","方法","包"],"answer":"B","explanation":"静态成员属于类，全局共享。"},{"id":"j079","moduleId":"module-14","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["modifier"],"question":"被 final 修饰的变量称为？","options":["静态变量","常量","局部变量","成员变量"],"answer":"B","explanation":"final 变量赋值后不可修改，即为常量。"},{"id":"j080","moduleId":"module-1","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["syntax","errorPoint"],"question":"Java 语句结束标志是？","options":[".",";",",",":"],"answer":"B","explanation":"分号 ; 是 Java 单行语句结束符。"},{"id":"j081","moduleId":"module-2","type":"single","difficulty":"easy","tags":["knowledgeBase"],"question":"以下哪项是字符类型？","options":["int","double","char","long"],"answer":"C","explanation":"char 为字符类型，用于存储单个字符。"},{"id":"j082","moduleId":"module-3","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["dataType"],"question":"数组访问下标越界会抛出？","options":["空指针异常","数组下标越界异常","类型转换异常","编译异常"],"answer":"B","explanation":"数组访问超出下标范围，抛出 ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException。"},{"id":"j083","moduleId":"module-4","type":"single","difficulty":"easy","tags":["operator"],"question":"赋值运算符是？","options":["==","=","!=",">="],"answer":"B","explanation":"= 用于赋值，== 用于判断相等。"},{"id":"j084","moduleId":"module-5","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["processControl"],"question":"do...while 循环的特点是？","options":["先判断后执行","先执行后判断","永不执行","执行两次"],"answer":"B","explanation":"do...while 至少执行一次循环体。"},{"id":"j085","moduleId":"module-6","type":"single","difficulty":"easy","tags":["function"],"question":"方法返回数据使用的关键字是？","options":["return","back","result","send"],"answer":"A","explanation":"return 实现方法数据返回。"},{"id":"j086","moduleId":"module-8","type":"single","difficulty":"medium","tags":["oop","classObj","errorPoint"],"question":"构造方法的名称要求是？","options":["固定为 init","与类名相同","任意名称","必须带返回值"],"answer":"B","explanatio